# Phase 1 – Brainstorming & Ideation

## Project Title
Implement Client Script & UI Policy (Incident)

## Introduction
This project focuses on implementing Client Scripts and UI Policies in ServiceNow for the Incident Management module.

## Problem Statement
Incident forms may contain unnecessary fields, incorrect field values, or fields that should be displayed or made mandatory based on specific conditions.

## Proposed Solution
Client Scripts and UI Policies are used to control the behavior of Incident form fields dynamically.

## Objectives
- Implement Client Scripts in the Incident table.
- Implement UI Policies for Incident forms.
- Make fields mandatory when required.
- Show or hide fields based on conditions.
- Control field behavior dynamically.
- Improve the Incident form user experience.

## Expected Outcome
The Incident form should dynamically respond to user actions and conditions using Client Scripts and UI Policies.
